# S5/Spring Boot FinLedger - patches all 5 flag paths
#
# Applied from /app inside the container:
#   patch -p1 < oracle_patch.diff
# Then recompile and restart:
#   supervisorctl restart app
#
# Patches:
#   flag_1 (A01) - add @PreAuthorize("hasRole('ADMIN')") to dashboard; restrict SecurityConfig
#   flag_2 (A02) - restrict actuator exposure to health only and require auth for actuator routes
#   flag_3 (A04) - switch to BCryptPasswordEncoder and hide serialized password hashes
#   flag_4 (A05) - parameterize JdbcTemplate search query
#   flag_5 (A07) - rotate seeded passwords to strong BCrypt hashes

